.title  The arm that adds up
.what   A robot arm in one table: every link inherits its parent's place AND its turn, and because every joint turns about the same axis the angles simply ADD
.tier   LESSON
.main   ARM.ASM
.needs  DRAW13.INC SINTAB.INC
.build  FASM ARM.ASM ARM.COM
.run    ARM.COM
.uses   XLATB IMUL SAR NEG CBW MUL TEST REP STOSB INT
.ignore MAKEINFO.BAT
